  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A smoky warm jade field can produce immortal material smoky warm jade. The field Ye Fan identifies is a few square kilometers of land and has extremely high value. It is a natural resource point: whichever clan controls it gains a sizeable amount of smoky warm jade each year. The field sits deep within an Earth Trench, with black soil firm like iron and colorful smoke rising from the soil into clouds, while Gu Masters on the ground feel warmth through body and soul.",
